{
  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "personal-health",
    "name": {
      "zh": "个人 AI 健康管家 + 社区医疗网络（千人千面协作）",
      "en": "Personal AI health concierge + community care network (one protocol, thousands of lives)"
    },
    "templateVersion": 2,
    "description": {
      "zh": "以人为本的未来社区健康场景：3 位市民（张大爷-65岁房颤高危独居老人、李女士-42岁高压力互联网中层、王同学-20岁食物过敏大学生）各自有一个终身陪伴的个人 AI 健康管家 Agent，跨 9 个 stakeholder 自主编排预防/急救/随访工作流：社区卫生服务中心、三甲医院急诊、心内科、智能药房（含无人机配送）、商业保险、社区物业、120 急救。每位市民的穿戴/家用 IoT 是个人 Agent 的私有设备；医院/药房/社区中心/EMS 各自私有化自己的设备；跨行业协作必须经 AC 协议完成（publish→discover→negotiate→execute）。本版在事件驱动之外内嵌确定性 Flow：张大爷心率异常自动守护（触发床头呼救+预授权 120 远程开门）与房颤检出跨主体联动（社区 12 导心电复测+药房无人机送抗凝药+腕表持续 ECG 上传），办公/商业/社区中心 zone 配 occupantSchedule 表达上下班人流。（v2.1 刷新：节点全部对齐引擎可执行命令面，内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）",
      "en": "A person-centric future-community health scenario: three citizens (Mr. Zhang, 65, high-risk AFib living alone; Ms. Li, 42, high-stress internet mid-manager; Student Wang, 20, food-allergy undergraduate) each have a lifelong personal AI health-concierge agent that autonomously orchestrates prevention / emergency / follow-up workflows across 9 stakeholders (community-health center, tertiary-hospital ED, cardiology, smart pharmacy with drone delivery, commercial insurance, community property, EMS-120). Each citizen's wearable / in-home IoT is the personal agent's private device; hospitals / pharmacies / community centers / EMS each privatize their own devices; every cross-entity collaboration is a publish → discover → negotiate → execute AC handshake. This revision additionally embeds deterministic flows — Mr. Zhang's tachycardia auto-guard (bedside emergency call + pre-authorized remote door unlock for EMS) and AFib-detected cross-entity linkage (community 12-lead ECG re-check + pharmacy drone anticoagulant delivery + continuous watch ECG streaming). Office / mall / community-center zones carry occupantSchedule for daily population flow. (v2.1 refresh: node capabilities aligned to the engine command surface; 2 embedded deterministic flows)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "你的 AI 健康管家，串起 9 个医疗主体",
      "en": "Your AI health concierge, orchestrating nine stakeholders"
    },
    "heroEventId": "evt-zhang-stroke",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 2,
    "vendorDisclaimer": {
      "zh": "场景中所有厂商名称（华为/Apple/Oura/BD Pyxis/ZOLL/Philips/Siemens/Mindray/Dräger 等）仅为具象化仿真使用，不构成任何商业代言或合作关系。",
      "en": "All vendor names appearing in this scenario (Huawei / Apple / Oura / BD Pyxis / ZOLL / Philips / Siemens / Mindray / Dräger, etc.) are used solely to concretize the simulation and do not constitute any commercial endorsement or partnership."
    }
  },
